# Google Play / Android Developer Identity — one-time package verification
#
# 1. Copy this file to:  .adi-registration.properties  (same folder as package.json)
# 2. Delete these comment lines. The file must contain ONLY the snippet Google gave you
#    (the line that looks like random letters/numbers — exact copy from Play Console).
# 3. Never commit .adi-registration.properties (it is listed in .gitignore).
#
# For EAS cloud builds without committing a local file: in the Expo dashboard,
# add a project environment variable ADI_REGISTRATION_SNIPPET (Production) with
# the same snippet value, or set it via the EAS CLI for environment variables.
#
# Replace the line below with your real snippet from Google, then delete all # lines above.

PASTE_GOOGLE_SNIPPET_HERE
